.el .ds Aq '
.TH ngx-history 1  "ngx-history " 
.SH NAME
ngx\-history \- List recorded changes (newest first), optionally only those touching one site
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBngx\-history\fR [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISITE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List recorded changes (newest first), optionally only those touching one site
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR [default: 20]
Show at most this many entries
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fISITE\fR]
Site ID or domain
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  ngx history
  ngx history 4
  ngx history \-\-json
